# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is committed.
#
# Which videos `npm run capture` records. One per language you care about —
# the point of capturing is to see what YouTube really sends, and videos differ
# in ways that matter: whether captions exist at all, whether the track is
# auto-generated, and whether it can be auto-translated.
#
# A full URL or a bare id, whitespace- or comma-separated.
#
# The real list is deliberately NOT committed. Which videos a developer tests
# against is a local choice, and a fixture list in the repository would be a
# list of URLs and committed transcripts nobody reviewed.

IU_CAPTURE_VIDEOS=
